01:04:36.036 --> 01:04:37.503
How many cameras do you have?


01:04:37.671 --> 01:04:40.401
Enough to know your accent's
faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:40.574 --> 01:04:44.032
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:44.211 --> 01:04:45.542
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:45.712 --> 01:04:50.411
And he found a loophole that allows me
to access that money your daddy left you...


01:04:50.584 --> 01:04:53.144
...should I need it for a medical reason.


01:04:53.320 --> 01:04:56.187
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:56.356 --> 01:05:00.019
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:05:00.493 --> 01:05:02.518
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:05:02.696 --> 01:05:04.561
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:04.731 --> 01:05:06.289
Hold the tonic.


01:05:16.009 --> 01:05:18.000
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:18.178 --> 01:05:19.702
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:19.880 --> 01:05:21.711
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:22.382 --> 01:05:24.748
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:24.918 --> 01:05:27.944
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:28.121 --> 01:05:29.452
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:29.623 --> 01:05:31.454
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:31.625 --> 01:05:35.026
