I hate you.


01:05:40.467 --> 01:05:42.731
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:42.903 --> 01:05:44.598
I know.


01:05:46.273 --> 01:05:49.106
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:49.276 --> 01:05:50.937
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:51.111 --> 01:05:53.944
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:54.114 --> 01:05:55.206
Are you an idiot?


01:05:55.382 --> 01:05:57.543
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:57.717 --> 01:05:59.582
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:59.753 --> 01:06:02.153
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:06:02.322 --> 01:06:04.517
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:04.691 --> 01:06:06.090
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:08.528 --> 01:06:10.155
I sort of love you too.


01:06:10.764 --> 01:06:15.224
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:15.702 --> 01:06:17.294
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:17.470 --> 01:06:19.404
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:19.572 --> 01:06:21.062
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:21.975 --> 01:06:23.306
Okay.


01:06:23.576 --> 01:06:27.979
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:43.496 --> 01:06:47.125
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:49.561
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:49.736 --> 01:06:51.829
Oh, okay.


01:06:52.005 --> 01:06:54.530
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:55.442 --> 01:06:59.344
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:07:00.313 --> 01:07:04.215
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:07:04.384 --> 01:07:06.909
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:07.087 --> 01:07:08.987
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:10.457 --> 01:07:14.894
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:16.763 --> 01:07:18.856
I don't know.


01:07:19.199 --> 01:07:21.463
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:21.634 --> 01:07:22.726
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:22.902 --> 01:07:25.370
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:25.538 --> 01:07:26.903
He'll say something like:


01:07:27.073 --> 01:07:30.008
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:30.176 --> 01:07:33.407
