01:08:03.710 --> 01:08:05.439
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:05.612 --> 01:08:07.546
Just look at Mom.


01:08:09.716 --> 01:08:10.842
You think I'm talented?


01:08:12.652 --> 01:08:14.745
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:16.456 --> 01:08:17.980
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:18.158 --> 01:08:20.126
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:23.229 --> 01:08:24.457
This better work.


01:08:25.031 --> 01:08:27.261
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:40.246 --> 01:08:43.909
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:44.084 --> 01:08:47.178
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:47.353 --> 01:08:51.346
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
