01:11:19.405 --> 01:11:21.839
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:32.318 --> 01:11:34.149
Okay.


01:11:36.389 --> 01:11:40.917
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:46.766 --> 01:11:47.790
Scratch that.


01:11:47.967 --> 01:11:50.902
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:59.612 --> 01:12:02.080
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:02.248 --> 01:12:06.150
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:08.955 --> 01:12:10.320
Move it. Guy.


01:12:10.490 --> 01:12:14.688
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:14.861 --> 01:12:16.328
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:16.496 --> 01:12:19.363
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
