Give me...


01:14:22.622 --> 01:14:26.718
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:27.126 --> 01:14:29.617
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:32.498 --> 01:14:34.625
<i>I don't know.
