01:16:10.029 --> 01:16:11.997
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:12.164 --> 01:16:13.961
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:14.133 --> 01:16:18.593
