01:16:57.143 --> 01:16:59.634
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:02.782 --> 01:17:05.182
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:08.487 --> 01:17:09.852
Hey. Clear.


01:17:12.959 --> 01:17:15.359
