We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:15.528 --> 01:17:16.825
Like what?


01:17:17.096 --> 01:17:18.961
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:19.131 --> 01:17:20.928
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:21.100 --> 01:17:26.470
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:29.241 --> 01:17:31.209
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:38.918 --> 01:17:42.911
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:46.025 --> 01:17:50.655
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:51.897 --> 01:17:55.458
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:55.635 --> 01:17:57.125
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:59.105 --> 01:18:02.541
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:02.708 --> 01:18:05.871
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:06.045 --> 01:18:08.980
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:09.148 --> 01:18:10.775
