<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:23.462 --> 01:18:26.659
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:26.832 --> 01:18:29.232
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:29.402 --> 01:18:32.530
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:34.006 --> 01:18:40.878
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:41.047 --> 01:18:44.710
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:44.884 --> 01:18:51.881
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:52.058 --> 01:18:55.323
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:55.494 --> 01:18:58.395
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:58.564 --> 01:19:05.993
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:06.172 --> 01:19:09.369
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:09.542 --> 01:19:12.511
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:12.678 --> 01:19:15.772
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:15.948 --> 01:19:18.439
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:18.617 --> 01:19:21.347
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:38.871 --> 01:19:40.532
