Guy!


01:21:27.079 --> 01:21:30.742
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:30.983 --> 01:21:34.749
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:36.222 --> 01:21:39.282
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:39.458 --> 01:21:42.052
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:42.228 --> 01:21:43.786
Let's try this again.


01:21:43.996 --> 01:21:45.861
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:47.433 --> 01:21:50.163
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:15.828 --> 01:22:18.058
Hey. Clear.


01:22:33.746 --> 01:22:35.907
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:36.081 --> 01:22:38.447
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:20.326 --> 01:23:22.920
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:23.095 --> 01:23:25.962
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:30.936 --> 01:23:34.463
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:40.913 --> 01:23:42.972
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:48.153 --> 01:23:52.453
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:56.895 --> 01:23:59.887
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:24:00.065 --> 01:24:02.192
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:21.687 --> 01:24:23.552
I love my life.


01:24:23.722 --> 01:24:25.917
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:48.380 --> 01:24:51.577
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

